 "comments": [
  {
   "address": 7680,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The first copied byte in the scene record is $08. The caller starts executing one byte later."
  },
  {
   "address": 7681,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Disable the sprites and load file LI through $0334 with selector 9. Set up two transfers, select the VIC bank at $4000 and multicolour bitmap mode, then request sound $82."
  },
  {
   "address": 7698,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "After LI returns, copy $8200\u2013$8600 to the colour matrix at $6000 and $7600\u2013$79EA to colour RAM at $D800. Configure multicolour bitmap mode in the $4000 VIC bank."
  },
  {
   "address": 7837,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Clear the runtime page at $0400 and set the sprite colours, pointers and coordinates from four tables at $30E9\u2013$3108."
  },
  {
   "address": 8016,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Update the two background regions selected by $0414 and service the scene delays between copies. The branch at $1F69 chooses between two event paths based on $0433."
  },
  {
   "address": 8675,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Read five bytes at $B002\u2013$B006 in reverse order, extract the colour nibble and write the results into the display scratch bytes at $21D7."
  },
  {
   "address": 8860,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Save 65 bytes from the sprite area at $6800 into RAM at $0458, copy in the new image from $A9F9 and set sprite 4 enabled and expanded."
  },
  {
   "address": 8954,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Copy from ($65) to ($67) inclusive through the source limit given in X/Y. Increment both pointers after each byte that precedes that limit."
  },
  {
   "address": 8996,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Set copy source high byte from X and low byte from Y."
  },
  {
   "address": 9001,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Set copy destination high byte from X and low byte from Y."
  },
  {
   "address": 9006,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Use A to select a pointer from $31C5 and a source index from $31CB. Copy sixteen bytes backward from the table at $3195 to that destination."
  },
  {
   "address": 10773,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Use Y to select the sprite 4 position and three pairs of patchable copy operands from the tables at $30BB, $30C7 and $30D3."
  },
  {
   "address": 10937,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Copy two bytes per X iteration from the ranges beginning at $BC00 and $BA00 into the current destination. The self-modified destination operands place the bytes into separate picture buffers."
  },
  {
   "address": 12431,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sprite pointer records read by the movement routines at $2D36 and $2BAA. The values run from $9E through $C5."
  },
  {
   "address": 12475,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Six little-endian source addresses installed in $2B14/$2B15 for the self-modifying copy at $2B13."
  },
  {
   "address": 12487,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Six address pairs patched into the second read operand at $2AC4/$2AC5 by the sprite-location selector."
  },
  {
   "address": 12499,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Six address pairs patched into the first read operand at $2ABE/$2ABF by the selector at $2A15."
  },
  {
   "address": 12511,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Five pairs of position bytes assigned to $D009 then $D008 by the selector at $2A15."
  },
  {
   "address": 12521,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Initial colours for sprites 0\u20137. The set-up reads them at $1ECB."
